{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1382268-dav20-road-of-blood-aura-modifiers","id":1382268,"title":"DAV20 - Road of Blood Aura Modifiers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-17T17:28:13-07:00","id":1382268,"title":"DAV20 - Road of Blood Aura Modifiers","content":"Organization: Sentinels often work alone and keep to themselves. They tend to set up areas to cover and rarely encounter one another. Most of their organization follows a mentor/student relationship as new members are trained in the Road. Otherwise, following the Road is very solitary. Each adherent travels to areas dictated by their clan, judging and dealing with the unworthy as necessary. Aura: Resolve. A follower of the Road of Blood takes his task seriously and is dedicated to following through. The aura modifier affects Willpower rolls.Virtues: Conviction and Self-Control.<br /> Page 432 of the book<br /> Can anyone explain to me how it really works with willpower rolls? Does it gives bonus dice? <br /> <br /> Thanks in advance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25853-moloch-the-gate-keeper","name":"Moloch The Gate Keeper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25853_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-18T00:57:48-07:00","id":1382295,"title":"","content":"Aura modifiers are important for those very high and very low on the road, to exemplify the kind of person being on the road makes you, and the things it trains you in. Aura modifier affects difficulties of rolls.<br /> It affects those on road rating 1-3, as well as road rating 8-10.<br /> A high rating gives you lower difficulty. 8-9 have -1 diff, while 10 gives you -2 diff on whatever rolls it affects.<br /> A low rating, meanwhile, INCREASES difficulty on the same scale. Road 3-2 gives +1 diff, and road 1 gives +2 diff on the related rolls.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Furthermore, I believe Carthage should be destroyed.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23835-pang4","name":"pang4","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-18T07:50:55-07:00","id":1382329,"title":"","content":"Once again, thank you very much for you kind answer sir. Do you have a page were I can find this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25853-moloch-the-gate-keeper","name":"Moloch The Gate Keeper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25853_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-18T10:58:50-07:00","id":1382350,"title":"","content":"Page 114 of DaV20, there's a chart ^^","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Furthermore, I believe Carthage should be destroyed.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23835-pang4","name":"pang4","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}